  "description": {
    "text": "Scarlet & Violet Energies lists eight basic Energy cards in the Scarlet & Violet design, one for each type, that print their type code (GRA, FIR, WAT, LIG, PSY, FIG, DAR or MET) where a card number would go. Holo versions in a new cracked-ice finish were among the second cards of the Journey Theme Pack, which came in gift boxes from 13 June 2025. The cards also come non-holo and in mirror holo.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: Gift boxes with the Journey Theme Pack (18 May 2025)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/15499.html"
      }
    ]
  },
